{"id":"en_mistaken-love-contract","title":"Mistaken Love Contract","titleEn":"Mistaken Love Contract","description":"Max Lowell entered a three-year contract marriage with Clara Stone, driven by a hidden motive: he wanted to harness her family's influence to track down Yulia Scott, the first love he had lost. As the agreement neared its conclusion, Clara unknowingly arranged an introduction between Max and Yulia, unaware that this was the very woman he had spent years seeking. Once Max and Yulia tied the knot, Clara was left to grapple with regret over the role she had played in bringing them together.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/mistaken-love-contract/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/mistaken-love-contract/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Angst","CEO","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbx00/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_mistaken-love-contract_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbx00/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_mistaken-love-contract_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbx00/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_mistaken-love-contract_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbx00/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_mistaken-love-contract_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dbx00/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_mistaken-love-contract_5",